### 4. `user_importer.py` — `import_users` (105-body lines → 7 helpers)

**Problem:** One giant function interleaving CSV reading, field-by-field validation for 6 fields, error collection, and 3 output file writes. Validation was a 40+ line nested `if/elif` block.

**Decomposition:**

| Extracted Helper           | Responsibility                                             |
|----------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|
| `_validate_email(v)`       | Single field check                                         |
| `_validate_name(v)`        | Single field check                                         |
| `_validate_age(v)`         | Parse + range check                                        |
| `_validate_password(v)`    | Min length check                                           |
| `_validate_role(v)`        | Enum membership check                                      |
| `_validate_row(row)`       | Composes per-field validators → `(errors, record_or_None)` |
| `_read_csv(path)`          | File I/O                                                   |
| `_write_valid_users(...)`  | File I/O                                                   |
| `_write_error_report(...)` | File I/O (returns `None` if no errors)                     |
| `_write_summary(...)`      | File I/O                                                   |
**Before — 40-line validation tunnel:**
```python
